14
00:00:26,806 --> 00:00:27,085
said.

15
00:00:27,225 --> 00:00:29,586
It also can't physically make that cut without

16
00:00:29,667 --> 00:00:32,246
writing complicated custom code, so we need

17
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:33,707
a package for that, FFMpeg.

18
00:00:34,067 --> 00:00:36,048
Claude can now read the transcript and decide

19
00:00:36,088 --> 00:00:38,109
what goes, so it takes out the silences, the

20
00:00:38,149 --> 00:00:40,530
