22
00:00:42,932 --> 00:00:44,872
It trims the clips, joins them back together,

23
00:00:44,993 --> 00:00:46,133
and cleans up your audio.

24
00:00:46,472 --> 00:00:48,314
It's free, and it's open source, and it turns

25
00:00:48,734 --> 00:00:51,176
25 minutes of raw footage into about 12 minutes

26
00:00:51,295 --> 00:00:52,155
of tight video.

27
00:00:52,356 --> 00:00:53,917
Once we've taken out all of our mistakes and

28
00:00:53,957 --> 00:00:56,457
silences, we've got our rough cut, but without

